<title>GERMANY: Goldman Sachs ups Viag to outperformer.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs ups Viag to outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Goldman Sachs said on Friday it had raised its rating for the German mixed utility group Viag AG to outperformer from performer.</p>
<p>Viag shares were up 15.50 marks at 704 marks in mid-session bourse trade, while the overall market was down 0.34 percent at 3,185.15 points.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
